{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"94c88f9e0b535563c7b8e170b797f2f2cbb97a64008fd75aa6f8b8ccea944cb4","ja":"甘い香りに誘われて","zh":"被甜美的香气吸引而来","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"58194d037419e1455672b0cb153dde07676d300892c4a1d699dfdbdb2b84530f","ja":"千鶴、ロコ、千早の3人は、\nバラエティ番組の収録で、街ブラロケに来ていて……","zh":"千鹤、ROCO和千早3人，\n为了录制综艺节目，来到街头进行外景漫步拍摄……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4b21c2a78c14671f17a7031379101f828629e86006b019361158222cfb78b8e8","ja":"あら？　なんだか甘い香りがしますわね。","zh":"哎呀？总觉得有一股甜甜的香气呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7b0a6138c7874bcf17133bb1fb55a2cf6888fde4acf1ad3d52dc50b81acd96dd","ja":"こちらのお店からですね。店頭に、\n焼き菓子が並んでいます。とてもたくさん……。","zh":"是从这家店开始对吧。店门前\n摆着好多烤点心。真的非常多……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f5f0f678a447c017b1df258429a00c663ff61b2659a7c6585dc60c2f0693708b","ja":"「移動販売するはずだったイベントが急に中止になって\n大量に作った分が、残ってしまったんです……」","zh":"“原本打算去流动摊位售卖的活动突然取消了，\n做好的大量商品，就这么剩了下来……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3e09b7ee362fc76c576c7777f8af84dac929aba246c83ade121cfaf07efe2e17","ja":"せっかく作ったのに、残念ですね……。","zh":"好不容易做好了，真可惜呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9a68c16c37d5d18d1a3c90eb4be54825390627976400d66e750dcaba51ff8fbd","ja":"（……はっ！　ここは、すべて買うのが\nセレブなのでしょうか！？）","zh":"（……啊！难道在这种时候，全都买下来\n才是名流的做法吗！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"66c6cb84f8d3d3726029369961afa9e8ff4aa87998abb88b2cb6517d8cd6995e","ja":"（みなさんもそれを期待して……でもドラマのように、\n本当に買うことはできませんし……）","zh":"（大家也在期待那个……但又不能像电视剧里那样\n真的买下来……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2c6dce9234c97059aec825e19ebce5ae7b7cc6c527baf7531e3ca587e6fd51f1","ja":"（そもそも、そうすることが本当に\n一番の解決策なのかどうか……）","zh":"（话说回来，那样做真的\n是最好的解决方法吗……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"73b2e155e1f46548764a42f7bb03c702bdbe73010141a33b3c8b15df43abcc05","ja":"このマドレーヌ、\nデザインがとってもラブリーですね♪","zh":"这个玛德莲蛋糕，\n设计非常可爱呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a896eeeb76c8f39b4a9fa66bfe95597fe95f454a0de80038dd06ae82c6087f43","ja":"「ありがとうございます。\nよかったらみなさん、試食してください」","zh":"“非常感谢。\n如果不介意的话，大家请来试吃一下吧”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"078269671c642e4491605b39400360684f0aaae73cad3ea40e3c3965b2a5b849","ja":"いただきます……とても、優しい甘さですね。\nこれなら、すぐ完売できたはずなのに……。","zh":"我开动了……真是非常温和纯正的甜味呢。\n按这样来看，明明应该很快就能卖完才对……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4af7c20816f6e0b385b84a24bfd53e5cdbaf297e0f733eb0d5830b41812c8616","ja":"……あ！　ではわたくしたちが、\n販売のお手伝いをするのはいかがでしょう？","zh":"……啊！那么由我们\n来帮忙售卖如何呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"dd92c1a6f2a0144e1720422c478c7b1fbf244b1c78051d1e83faccfd75460dcc","ja":"せっかくの美味しくて愛らしい焼き菓子、\nみなさまにも、知っていただくべきですわ！","zh":"这么美味又可爱的点心，\n一定要让各位也品尝到才行呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"54fa6d65a52d90ea553c392a577af9624cc3e631a45e76970b5ab3c13c0702b1","ja":"そうですね。店員さんがよければ、ぜひ。","zh":"好的。如果店员不介意的话，请务必让我试试。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1717.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e32a566ddc281281754cc1df93f6d5290ca8f56f16b3c9c8ee156779847211c4","ja":"ラッピングは、ロコに任せてください～♪","zh":"包装就交给ROCO吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
